Vela：恢复播放时重置 KSPlayer 时钟参照时刻。

KSClock.getTime() 用「上次更新的时间 + 之后经过的真实时间」外推。暂停期间时钟不更新，恢复后在音频输出第一帧前，
时钟会超前整段暂停时长，视频同步因此连续丢帧 / 冲刷视频队列，表现为恢复播放后有声音但画面卡住数秒。

diff --git a/Sources/KSPlayer/MEPlayer/KSMEPlayer.swift b/Sources/KSPlayer/MEPlayer/KSMEPlayer.swift
index 3850faa..9f01566 100644
--- a/Sources/KSPlayer/MEPlayer/KSMEPlayer.swift
+++ b/Sources/KSPlayer/MEPlayer/KSMEPlayer.swift
@@ -158,6 +158,7 @@ private extension KSMEPlayer {
                 self.audioOutput.pause()
                 self.videoOutput?.pause()
             } else {
+                self.playerItem.resetClockReference()
                 self.audioOutput.play()
                 self.videoOutput?.play()
             }
diff --git a/Sources/KSPlayer/MEPlayer/MEPlayerItem.swift b/Sources/KSPlayer/MEPlayer/MEPlayerItem.swift
index 811139c..9216c05 100644
--- a/Sources/KSPlayer/MEPlayer/MEPlayerItem.swift
+++ b/Sources/KSPlayer/MEPlayer/MEPlayerItem.swift
@@ -837,6 +837,15 @@ extension MEPlayerItem: OutputRenderSourceDelegate {
         isAudioStalled ? videoClock : audioClock
     }
 
+    /// Vela: re-anchor both clocks to "now" when playback resumes. `KSClock.getTime()` extrapolates with the
+    /// wall time elapsed since the last update, so after a pause it jumps ahead by the whole pause duration
+    /// until the audio output renders again; the video sync then drops / flushes frames for seconds
+    /// (audio plays, picture frozen).
+    func resetClockReference() {
+        audioClock.time = audioClock.time
+        videoClock.time = videoClock.time
+    }
+
     public func setVideo(time: CMTime, position: Int64) {
 //        print("[video] video interval \(CACurrentMediaTime() - videoClock.lastMediaTime) video diff \(time.seconds - videoClock.time.seconds)")
         videoClock.time = time
